#While loop
-conditional based loop run until when condition is true/keep on checking the condition everytime it runs or execute programs
Syntax:
while condition:
    statement

#infinite loop
-while loop keep on executing when condition never becomes false
eg-
while true:
    print("hello")

#Random modules
-python code written and saving in files and using this file in other file
-using import random we can use random functions
-random()-returns random float between 0.0 and 1.0 (excluded)
-randint(a,b)-returns random int between a and b (both excluded)
